     "noise",
     "silence"
    ],
    "what": "4 s each: white noise at -75..-46 dBFS (silence); 1/f noise at -50..-32 dBFS (noise); a -60 dBFS floor with one 0.5 s breath-like burst (300-2500 Hz, raised-cosine) at -40..-17 dBFS (breath); -50 dBFS 1/f noise, 60 Hz hum, two bursts and a click (line). 8 kHz: low-passed, decimated, G.711 mu-law round trip."
   },
   "through_server": "each clip sent over the protocol at 16 kHz and at 8 kHz, Finalize at the end; a clip counts when any final carried text; 'conf_ge_0_5' applies STT_MIN_CONFIDENCE=0.5 to the same finals (the server drops a final whose mean token probability is below the setting, so the count is what that setting would have left)",
